  "task_assistant_messages": [
    "1 dozen equals \\(12\\) balloons. Since each package contains \\(2\\) balloons:\n\n\\[\n12 \\div 2 = 6\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{6\\text{ packages}}\n\\]",
    "A dozen is \\(12\\) balloons. With \\(2\\) balloons per package:\n\n\\[\n12 \\div 2 = 6\n\\]\n\nThe price change does not affect the number of packages. They bought:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{6\\text{ packages}}\n\\]\n\n(Their total cost was \\(6 \\times \\$0.50 = \\$3.00\\).)",
